# Identity

Read [`docs/adr/0003-auth0-opaque-sessions.md`](../../docs/adr/0003-auth0-opaque-sessions.md)
and [`docs/adr/0004-fixed-roles.md`](../../docs/adr/0004-fixed-roles.md).

- Browser gets only an opaque HttpOnly session cookie.
- Roles and capabilities live in `src/domain/roles.ts`. Capability sets are
  currently identical; do not invent per-role differences.
- Other modules may import only `AuthGuard` and `RequireCapability` from
  `auth.guard.ts`.
- Tests use the fake identity adapter, not Auth0.
